agende is a Go rewrite inspired by mastodon-post-scheduler by Sean S. LeBlanc
(https://github.com/seleb/mastodon-post-scheduler), declared MIT in its
package.json. No code from that project is included.

assets/artefatos.css and its IBM Plex fonts come from the bolha artefatos site.
The fonts are under the SIL Open Font License, see assets/fonts/OFL.txt.
